  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut cauliflower into small florets. Cut potato into bite-sized chunks.<br>• Spread cauliflower and potato on lined oven tray, sprinkle over masala spice blend, drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.<br>• Toss to coat, spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e17b83c0c3e7ed01a8b/step-49a60000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion (see ingredients) and garlic. Rinse red lentils.<br>• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat with the butter and a drizzle of olive oil.<br>• Cook onion, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 mins.<br>• Add garlic and Mumbai spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e17b83c0c3e7ed01a8b/step-77a06410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add lentils, coconut milk, the water and stock powder.<br>• Bring to a simmer, then cover with a lid. Simmer, stirring occasionally, until lentils are tender, 18-20 mins.<br>• When lentils are soft, stir through the roasted veggies, baby spinach leaves and a small drizzle of white wine vinegar and season.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e17b83c0c3e7ed01a8b/step-7ccd3c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice long chilli (if using).<br>• Divide lentil stew between bowls. Top with chilli to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13e17b83c0c3e7ed01a8b/step-1b4ea230.jpg"
    }
  ]
